      "SummaryOfActivities": "Our achievements included: -Six major national submissions shaping migration, regional planning, humanitarian programs, anti-racism and family violence funding; -SCOA evidence cited 16 times in Migration: Pathway to Nation Building; -Representation across 97 national advisory forums; -Over 100 member and sector consultations; -Publication of 'A Snapshot of the Settlement Sector' highlighting 21 case studies; -Progress on revising the National Settlement Outcomes Standards and Settlement Sector Quality Framework; and -Recognition of sector excellence through 89 Outstanding Settlement Contribution Award nominations.",
